        { q: "Why do so many personal injury attorneys refer patients to an auto accident chiropractor?", a: "Chiropractic care focuses on restoring joint movement and function, and it documents your injuries and progress. That combination supports both your recovery and your claim." },
        { q: "Do chiropractors work with other doctors?", a: "Yes. At Palm Wellness Center, chiropractic care is coordinated with medical providers and rehabilitation services so your care stays connected." },
        { q: "What happens if I miss the 14-day window to seek medical care under Florida PIP?", a: "Florida PIP generally requires you to be seen within 14 days of the accident to qualify for coverage. If you are unsure about your timing, call us and we will help you understand your options." },
      ],
    },
    area: {
      eyebrow: "Service Area",
